{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#card-zh","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 是面向 DSH Web 的本地用量统计看板，在设置的“数据看板”页面展示会话聚合结果。插件从本地会话日志构建 rollup，并通过 session/event 增量更新，提供 Token 与估算费用 KPI、按时间范围和模型/项目筛选的趋势图与热力图、模型和项目分布、日历视图、模型效能与缓存洞察，以及可分页的详细记录和 CSV 导出。适合希望在 DSH 内查看历史用量、费用趋势和模型表现的用户；统计在本机完成，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:898","src/host.js:1038","src/client/index.js:20","src/core/rollup.js:1083"]}
{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#card-en","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard adds a local usage dashboard to the DSH web client. It summarizes tokens, estimated costs, session trends, model and project distributions, calendar activity, cache insights, detailed records, and CSV exports. Users can filter by date, model, and project; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:898","src/host.js:1038","src/client/index.js:20","src/core/rollup.js:1083"]}
