{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#feature-1","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 的功能「时间范围与筛选」：支持今天、24 小时、7/30/90 天和自定义时间范围，并可按模型、项目过滤看板数据。 在设置中的数据看板查看，按所选时间范围、模型或项目生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1038","src/client/index.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#feature-2","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 的功能「用量趋势与分布」：展示 Token、估算费用和时长的趋势、分时热力图，以及按模型和项目拆分的用量分布。 在设置中的数据看板查看，按所选时间范围、模型或项目生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/rollup.js:1083","src/client/index.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#feature-3","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 的功能「日历活跃视图」：将最近会话的每日 Token 用量汇总为日历热力图，并支持模型或项目筛选。 在设置中的数据看板查看，按所选时间范围、模型或项目生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/rollup.js:1907","src/client/index.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#feature-4","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 的功能「明细与 CSV 导出」：浏览按时间桶、模型和项目分组的用量明细，并导出筛选范围内的 CSV。 在设置中的数据看板查看，按所选时间范围、模型或项目生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:1050","src/client/index.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"skkjkk__dsh-usage-dashboard#caveat-1","repo":"skkjkk/dsh-usage-dashboard","commit":"6db146eb5ff984ad2017d271fa2a211d424e02c2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-dashboard 使用本地定价表估算费用；定价表未匹配的模型不会得到实际账单金额，界面显示为未匹配或零值。统计范围也限于当前普通会话布局，旧式裸 UUID 目录和子代理会话不纳入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/rollup.js:1","src/host.js:1"]}
